{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682420/extras/aboutthedemo.gif?t=1749713685\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Limb Driver&quot;</strong> is a dark psychological horror experience that pushes the limits of the human mind. This demo version allows you to explore the game's first chapter, test core mechanics, and feel its immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682420/extras/wisdemo.gif?t=1749713685\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to the game's <strong>first chapter</strong>: Follow the traces of the past and witness the character's psychological unraveling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive environment</strong>: A deep exploration experience through diaries, photos, old TVs, and audio devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sound and atmosphere</strong>: A cinematic experience enriched with realistic sound design and environmental detail.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682420/extras/demoduration.gif?t=1749713685\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately <strong>15\u201330 minutes</strong> of gameplay duration.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682420?t=1749713685","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682420?t=1749713685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682420/6d87a94eab761c5f2c88a5b9eb70fb3263a9f373/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749713685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682420/6d87a94eab761c5f2c88a5b9eb70fb3263a9f373/capsule_184x